The connotation ( in at least one sense) of many 'again's is that the previ=
ous doing was some way inadequate.  I doubt there is a way to build that br=
iefly into aLojban sentence and it would be improper to do so as it comes n=
ot from the words but from their being uttered in a certain context.  The s=
ame is true of the habitual, repetitive sense.

